    "dataAccessPlace": "The replication package for this study is archived within Tilburg University network drive. \nThe package contains the replication materials that accompany the article \"The Bullwhip Effect in Servitized Manufacturers\", Management Science (2024). The code is written in Stata (Version 15) and uses self-collected data from SEC EDGAR 10-K filings and data from Compustat and CRSP. \nAccording to the terms of use of the afore mentioned databases, the package cannot be published or made openly available for access. ",
